/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_568857855796813_5401280815376791430_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h5A9urDXXeoQ7kNvwHpuoQy&_nc_oc=Admp0-ohx7nctmXvWEmN2XOOZRq3nKRkW6iqH8GzaKiJ07yLDbQcwP-ww2HcSVFWJes&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyId3j-dLulVUMByDxEiU7WGfCs1JwQBzsgzPBhh_7itw&oe=69BEA403"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The use of descending life line_Landscape.png", "id": "924296409342275", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86629761_924296412675608_6973496143769541780_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z-HmK037IFkQ7kNvwGFbGOd&_nc_oc=AdnY9QMd09lcqMXtPVUovlHLhK1ai31Mbzr9Pq99mFr9ox6HEAWh15G1B-qR4bSKba4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwAYK2ygQNQ8xH_2DR0ILGInUnqZPS_zRM3uxX9jT4Alg&oe=69BE8E78"}, "display_name": "The Use Of Descending Life Line- ContentsDa", "keywords": ["safety", "fire", "descent", "simulation", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. Fire situation: There is a fire and you need to escape.\n2. Use the sturdy: Utilize the sturdy to escape.\n3. Install the Stubborn: Install the green hook from the Stubborn box onto the Stubborn support.\n4. Set the speeder: Set the red speeder by overlapping it on the hook.\n5. Move the Stubborn Support: Grab the Stubborn Support and move it off the railing.\n6. Throw the rope: Throw the rope wound on the black reel out the window.\n7. Manipulate the stubbornness belt: Lower the yellow stubbornness belt under your armpits and tighten it.\n8. safe descent: Hold onto the wall with your hands and descend safely without lifting your arms.\n9. successful escape: You have safely escaped and overcome the fire situation.", "short_description": "Understand the critical use of life lines in rescue operations. This experiment teaches the proper techniques for descending from heights safely."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-p